1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,921
Why does your phone go dark through sunglasses?

2
00:00:03,221 --> 00:00:06,381
Tilt your head, and the picture usually comes back.

3
00:00:06,881 --> 00:00:10,369
Light is a wave, and it can wiggle in any direction.

4
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:14,787
Many phone screens only let out light that wiggles one way.

5
00:00:15,287 --> 00:00:17,976
Polarized sunglasses are a filter too.

6
00:00:18,276 --> 00:00:24,590
Worn upright, they only pass up-and-down wiggles, to block the glare off roads and water.

7
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:28,456
Line the two filters up, and the light gets through.

8
00:00:28,756 --> 00:00:31,507
Turn one a quarter turn, and they cross.

9
00:00:31,507 --> 00:00:33,020
Almost nothing passes.

10
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:35,561
Your screen never switched off.

11
00:00:35,561 --> 00:00:37,470
Your glasses just blocked it.
